// # 2026-09-11 Volume Cert — std/
//
// Logline: Mechanical pass to classify every .oo file in std/ as
//          GREEN (has caller), BLOCKED (no caller), RESIDUAL
//          (intentional), ANCHOR (front door), or PROBE (qa/).
//          Closes dead-code sweep note n1 (deferred from the
//          2026-09-11 polyrepo rollup).
//
// Setup:  Authored 2026-09-11 by Mavis. CSV artifact at
//         `std/audit/2026-09-11-volume-cert.csv` (5892 rows incl.
//         header). Method: per-file grep across std/ for an
//         `import "<basename>.oo"` reference in any other .oo.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Verdict table.
//   2. Method.
//   3. Counts by status + domain.
//   4. Top BLOCKED (candidates for cleanup or promotion).
//   5. Recommended next actions.

// ## 1. Verdict

// | Status   | Count | Meaning                                          |
// |----------|------:|---------------------------------------------------|
// | GREEN    |  4496 | Imported by ≥ 1 other .oo                         |
// | BLOCKED  |   427 | No caller found; candidate for cleanup/promotion |
// | RESIDUAL |   721 | Intentional (private sibling, scratch, examples, meta/test) |
// | ANCHOR   |   192 | Front-door ANCHOR.oo files (RULES §1.19)          |
// | PROBE    |    55 | qa/ probes (RULES §1.4)                           |
// | TOTAL    |  5891 |                                                   |

// ## 2. Method

// For each .oo file in std/ (excluding audit/, .ooda-cache/, build/):
//   - If path matches `./qa/`: classify PROBE.
//   - If basename is `ANCHOR`: classify ANCHOR.
//   - If path matches `./scratch/` or `./examples/` or `./meta/test/`:
//     classify RESIDUAL.
//   - If basename matches `_law`, `_theory`, `_principle`,
//     `_invariant`, `_kat`, `_stubs`, `_types` (per
//     science/ANCHOR.oo §2 — private siblings): classify RESIDUAL.
//   - Otherwise: grep across std/ for any other .oo that imports
//     this basename. ≥ 1 hit → GREEN. 0 hits → BLOCKED.
//
// CSV artifact: `std/audit/2026-09-11-volume-cert.csv` — 5892 rows
// (1 header + 5891 .oo files), one row per file with status +
// evidence (caller or classification reason).

